  :canonical-type-or-fact-family "NEW fact types `enum` (:required (classification) :optional (owner-subsystem frozen canonical) :ref ((owner-subsystem subsystem) (canonical rationale))) and `enum-value` (:required (enum value) :optional (ordinal label obligation binding sa) :ref ((enum enum))). flattening rule: one `enum` fact per define-closed-enum (id = enum name, TOKEN) + one `enum-value` fact per member (id = <enum>__<VALUE>, :enum <enum> :value <VALUE> :ordinal <n>); keyword members rendered as bare symbols by colon-strip (orchestrator-notes.md N12); per-member attributes (:label/:obligation/:binding/:sa) become STRING/SYMBOL fields of the enum-value fact; 16 enum + 83 enum-value facts"
  :owner "MIXED by form, none declared as a registry fact: S03 inferred for SemanticAdmissionAssuranceProfile/DivergenceState (field types of SemanticAdmissionEvidence/1 V1.5:34,38; owner S03 ISR:59, interfaces-and-types.sexp:56); S01 inferred for enumerability_class/availability_class (field types of CensusSpaceClassification/1 V1.5:199-200; owner S01 ISR:61) and for the decision inputs observation_state/availability_state/acquisition_state/validation_state/negative_evidence_validity (inputs of S01's census-coverage-decision V1.5:230; SR:36); S10 inferred for IndependenceAssuranceProfile/IndependenceDimension/unknown_handling (field types of IndependencePolicy/1 V1.5:412-417; owner S10 ISR:63); S04 inferred for ArgumentScheme/StatementTargetKind (C1 seat V1.5:442-446; InterpretiveProfile/1 owner S04 ISR:65); UNKNOWN for StateEventKind (no field of any registry has this type; D1 seat S03 V1.5:10-11 vs SR:56 S07 'later-treatment (v1.5 D1.5)') and admission_obligation_state (S01 input produced by S03's D1 gate, no registry assigns it)"
  :writer "NO_WRITER for the enum facts themselves (closed value domains are declared, not written at runtime; the model's only declared no-writer seat is SEAT-NO-WRITER seats.sexp:99-100 for stores) — the writer of INSTANCES carrying these values is the writer of the record's store where one exists (e.g. coverage-ledger writer SEAT-COVERAGE-OWNER stores-and-authorities.sexp:6 for the D2 values); no registry names a writer for an enum"
