  :proposed-canonical-target-module "NEW:decision-functions.sexp — no existing module can hold it without a second concept per module: dependencies-and-boundaries.sexp is the pipeline/consumes universe (AM/dependencies-and-boundaries.sexp:5-21,23-124) and a decision is not a stage; requirements-tests-workpackets.sexp is the L6 chain (:5-95); none of the 34 fact types (AM/MODEL-SCHEMA.sexp:84-288) is a function. Naming is ADJ-DDI3-MOD-1."
