  :conflict-duplicate-seat-risk "A second `decision` fact for the SAME concept (census coverage decision) if V1.7-SCHEMAS__define-decision-function is also imported (ids differ, so L2 will NOT catch it — no law keys facts by concept); a third textual seat in prose: :V5I-04 (V1.5:246-253) and :V7I-COV-availability-live (V1.7:280-284) both restate the clause logic (DDI-4). Live disagreement: SR:36 names the V1.5 id, TM:367 the -v7 id."
