  :owner "S04 — inferred (the form carries no owner): the ISR-registered sibling InterpretiveProfile/1 has :owner S04 (INTERFACE-AND-SCHEMA-REGISTRY.sexp:65; interfaces-and-types.sexp:28); V1.6-SCHEMAS.sexp:97 names the seat of 'v1.5 C1 records' as 'legal-ast.lisp + LAWMAX-LEGAL-IR-SEMANTIC-CONTRACT.md' = SEAT-LEGAL-AST, S04's owner-seat (seats.sexp:32-33; subsystems.sexp:8). 9 of the 12 step targets (CanonRule/1, CanonPolicy/1, ClaimRecord/1, ArgumentRecord/1, ArgumentRelation/1, LifecycleRecord/1 and the 3 projections) are NOT model types and have no ISR owner → their owner is UNKNOWN as a fact."
