  :current-authority-seat "V1.7-SCHEMAS.sexp, one invariant closing each of sections 0-16: 5 root invariants :RA-I-1..:RA-I-5 at :14,17,20,23,26 and 18 section invariants :V7I-* at :95,111,115,139,166,180,199,212,234,249,280,297,301,318,337,353,372,400 (full list classes.md row 37). Ledger seat: deferred-imports.sexp:45 (:source-count 23, DDI-4, AUTHORITATIVE_AT_SOURCE). No model fact carries any of these ids (grep of the 14 modules = 0)."
