  :adjudication-items ("ADJ-V17-CO-1" "ADJ-V17-CO-2" "ADJ-V17-REC-2 (ClarifiedInterpretation/1 double define-record V1.7:75 / V1.8:40)" "ADJ-V17-REF-1 (MorphLattice/1, PackedParseForest/1, DiscourseState/1, PromotionEvidence/1 absent from ISR and model — no owner-subsystem possible, MODEL-SCHEMA.sexp:149)" "ADJ-MX1-CO7-1 (new): :preserves / :branch / :no-forced-winner / :binds-exact-candidate content has no V1.8 successor seat — retirement of V1.7 is a silent loss unless seated" "ADJ-MX1-CO7-2 (new): batch DISAGREES (targets DDI-2; successor DDI-3)")
