  :current-authority-seat "V1.7-SCHEMAS.sexp, section ';; ==== 10. C-11 CORRECTED COVERAGE DECISION (availability LIVE)' (V1.7:254-256: 'Supersedes census-coverage-decision (v1.5 R3) ... v1.5 files are NOT edited; this is the v1.7 corrected seat'), preceded by define-reference availability_state / census_coverage_state (V1.7:257-258), form census-coverage-decision-v7 V1.7:259-279 (:supersedes L260, :inputs L261, :output L262, 7 :clauses L264-277, :precedence L278, :total/:single-valued L279); invariant :V7I-COV-availability-live V1.7:280-284. Ledger: AM/deferred-imports.sexp:44 (DDI-3). SUPERSEDED-REGISTER.md:257-258; TM:367 (RA-C11, S01, coverage-ledger.lisp, RA-Q-COV, WP-01)."
