  :requirement "R-132 (S01 req-map AM/requirements-tests-workpackets.sexp:67). Source RA-C11 (TM:367) is NOT a model fact — NEW (the RA-* universe is orchestrator N1's open question: seat of requirement ids)."
  :invariant "L1/L3/L6 as row 1. Source guard: :V7I-COV-availability-live V1.7:280-284 ('availability is a LIVE input (guard clause 4 AND :PUBLIC_PRESENT)'). Constitutional: public/private one-way boundary (deployment/LAWMAX-THREAT-MODEL.md; RAT-PUBPRIV anchor dangling, orchestrator N17) — this clause is the census-side expression of it. NEW model check: every declared `decision-input` appears in at least one `decision-condition` (DECISION-INPUT-UNUSED) — note the V1.5 form FAILS this check as written (availability declared V1.5:230, tested nowhere V1.5:233-244), which is the very defect C-11 corrects (V1.7:255-256)."
  :qualification-test "Existing: Q01 (S01 req-map test :67). Source: RA-Q-COV (TM:367) — registered nowhere else (grep: only TM:367), not a model `test` fact. NEW executable statement: T-DDI3-COV-GUARD — over the 120000-combination product (row 1), every combination with availability in {COVERED_STATE_NON_PUBLIC, ACCESS_RESTRICTED, LICENSING_RESTRICTED, UNKNOWN} that is not QUARANTINED by clauses 1-3 yields UNKNOWN, and no combination yields INGESTED unless availability = PUBLIC_PRESENT."
