seats.sexp:73-74) and SidecarSourceProfile/1 (:SPECIFICATION_ONLY, S26) force a package SPLIT: a private record cannot share the public package of its owner (ADJ-V18-REC-3) | invariant: V8I-PUBPRIV-all-families (V1.8:277-283); L5 | fallback: monolith package (deployment/collab/design/OMEGA2/CHANGE-PROPOSAL/LAWMAX-COMMON-LISP-NATIVE-CONSTRUCTION-CONTRACT.md:31) — inadmissible for the 2 private records" :persistent-event "PublicCorrectionEvent/1 (tombstone, :status :REPLACED/:WITHDRAWN, no republished content V1.8:160-164), RecoveryEpoch/1 (monotonic N+1 V1.8:226-230), ReAnchoringManifest/1, EmergencyFreeze/1, ClarificationRequest/Response are journaled events via source/journal.lisp:507 chained-append (atomic compare-and-append under lock; stale-chain-link :495); the chain must verify with 'content unavailable/withdrawn' WITHOUT retaining withdrawn bytes (V1.8:173-174) — the journal's payload-hash chaining (source/version-graph.lisp:498-506 %payload-hash) is the mechanism to bind a tombstone in place of content | invariant: append-only; correction never re-publishes (V8I-CORR-privacy V1.8:168-174); single writer (V8I-OWN-universal V1.8:296-299) | fallback: write-file-atomic" :truth-maintenance-dependency "RelianceProjection/1 is DERIVED, total, deterministic and preserves ALL simultaneous causes (V1.8:84-87, :97-103): a dependency-directed recomputation over the 8 dimension states (DDI-3 reliance-of V1.8:411-414) — the CL-native seat is the JTMS/dependency idiom (source/legal-inference-engine.lisp:238 make-jtms; :385 fact-status (:in/:undefined/:out/:unknown); :395 tms-retract-premise; deployment/collab/design/OMEGA2/CHANGE-PROPOSAL/LAWMAX-COMMON-LISP-NATIVE-CONSTRUCTION-CONTRACT.md:29), never a scalar stored truth (V1.8:74 'No scalar stored truth'); ClarifiedInterpretation :ABSTAIN = :undefined status | invariant: V8I-RASTATUS-product (V1.8:97-103): recovery of one dimension never silently recovers another; self-qualification rejected | fallback: full recompute (dep