  :canonical-type-or-fact-family "NEW `capability` (:kind enum {CODE DOCUMENT} :seat ref seat :package STRING :symbol STRING :section STRING :subsystem ref subsystem :requirement ref requirement :test ref test) with two define-conditional rules (CODE requires package+symbol and forbids section; DOCUMENT requires section and forbids package/symbol — the MODEL-SCHEMA.sexp:26-30 mechanism) — 7 facts with ids RESOLVE_IDENTIFIER PUBLIC_RETRIEVAL CITATION_MEASURE DATASET_DISTRIBUTE JURIS_RATIO RIGHTS_LICENSE EXPRESSION_TRANSLATE. :file → seat ref: 3 files coincide with existing seats (SEAT-CANONICAL-URIS seats.sexp:62, SEAT-STATIC-SITE :48, SEAT-AI-CORPUS-DUMP :64); 4 need NEW seats (BUILT source/ai-citation-strategy.lisp; BUILT source/legal-decisions.lisp; DOCUMENT_SEAT deployment/collab/design/OMEGA2/CHANGE-PROPOSAL/LAWMAX-LICENSE-POLICY.md; DOCUMENT_SEAT deployment/LAWMAX-UNIVERSAL-SOURCE-CONTRACT.md) — each a SECOND seat of its subsystem (S15, S07, S25, S16) against seats.sexp:21-23, and each would trip SEAT-UNREFERENCED (gate_checks.py:805-808) unless check_seats learns the new fact type."
  :owner "per row (V1.8:243-249 :subsystem): S25 ×2 (L243, L248), S13 (L244), S15 (L245), S14 (L246), S07 (L247), S16 (L249) — all model subsystems, all PUBLIC (subsystems.sexp:29,17,19,18,11,20); agree with the ISR for the named types (ISR:87 RightsMatrix/1 S25). Class-level: TRACEABILITY-MATRIX.md:385 DFT-05 subsystem S04 (WP-08). Note: S14's capability file is SEAT-AI-CORPUS-DUMP (owner of store dataset-distribution, seats.sexp:64) while S14's owner-seat is SEAT-CAPABILITY-API (subsystems.sexp:18)."
  :writer "NO_WRITER — the form declares no store; `writer` is a field of `store` only (MODEL-SCHEMA.sexp:155-158). Imported facts are authored in the target module under its 'thereafter EDIT HERE' header (e.g. interfaces-and-types.sexp:2)."
  :classification "PUBLIC (7/7 subsystems PUBLIC; both DOCUMENT seats are AUTHORED_NORMATIVE_PROSE, files-and-roles.sexp:404,48)."
  :dependencies ("subsystem facts S25 S13 S15 S14 S07 S16 (existing; dag.json 7 refs)" "seat facts: 3 existing (seats.sexp:62,48,64) + 4 NEW (ADJ-V18-CAP-2)" "requirement facts RA-I RA-R RA-K RA-T RA-J RA-L RA-E — NOT model facts (N1; TRACEABILITY-MATRIX.md:346-353)" "test facts: RA-Q-RESOLVE exists (requirements-tests-workpackets.sexp:44); RA-Q-RETRIEVE RA-Q-CITE RA-Q-DATASET RA-Q-JURIS RA-Q-LICENSE RA-Q-TRANSLATE — NOT model facts" "wp facts for L6: TRACEABILITY:346-353 gives FUTURE_BOOK ×2 / WP-12 / WP-03/WP-09 / WP-09 / WP-13 / WP-11 — 'FUTURE_BOOK' is not a wp fact (ADJ-V18-WP-1); the form carries no :wp" "type RightsMatrix/1 (interfaces-and-types.sexp:52) as the :section of L248; DDI-2 V1.8 define-reference USC-expression (V1.8:107-108) shares the L249 locator 'lawmax/expression/1'")
