  :batch-reason "DDI-4 because build_deferred.py:102 maps `define-wp-reconciliation` to DDI-4. AGREES on batch — its 10 out-edges point at a DDI-4 sibling (define-wp-purpose) and dag.json records no order violation naming it as a target. Same hidden constraint as class 13: the real order is intra-batch (class 2 before classes 13 and 15, and class 14's :V8I-WP-real after both), which the ledger's single :batch field cannot express."
  :decision-kind "ARCHITECTURAL_DECISION_REQUIRED"
