  :adjudication-items ("ADJ-V18-WP-1 (V1.8 dossier) = ADJ-V17-WP-2 = A14-SR-FUTURE-TOKEN-NAMING = orchestrator-notes.md N2: four tokens for one disposition; TENANT_PROFILES FUTURE vs DEFERRED" "ADJ-V18-WP-2 (V1.8 dossier): 20-row vs 16-row divergence, four concepts dropped without a note" "ADJ-V18-WP-3 (V1.8 dossier): three seats for WP assignment, disagreeing for LEGAL_IR (V1.8:307 vs rtw:70)" "ADJ-V18-WP-4 (V1.8 dossier): evidence-string standard — generic words satisfy the grep test but not the grounding claim" "ADJ-MX4-ANON-ID (new, shared with class 13): one id-synthesis convention for the corpus's 7 anonymous forms" "ADJ-MX4-DDI4-INTERNAL-ORDER (new, shared with class 13)")
