  :qualification-test "Existing: Q08 (:70). Source: T8-COGLIFE (TM:387; QT:1163 UNEXECUTED); legacy 'incompatible-edge-type' / 'held/incompatible-resume-edge' / 'held/incompatible-terminal-edge' (V1.8-VERIFY.py:1631,1637-1638). NEW executable statement: T-DDI3-COG-TYPED — for every `cog-edge` of family FLOW/BRANCH/TERMINAL, out(:from) = in(:to) as declared by `cog-node-type`; for every RESUME edge there is a `resume-binding` fact whose :request-type = out(:from) and :response-type = in(:to); every TERMINAL-kind node has :out TERMINAL."
