  :canonical-type-or-fact-family "NEW `aggregation` (id reliance-of; :output-enum SYMBOL RelianceClass; :input-type ref type RootAuthorityStatus/1; :projection-type ref type RelianceProjection/1; :policy SYMBOL root-authority-dimensions (ref `policy` if row 8 declares it); :total YES; :deterministic YES; :preserve-causes YES; :advisory-never-blocks YES; :self-qualification REJECTED (NEW enum with the single value REJECTED so ACCEPTED is L1-impossible); :rule-kind MIN-OVER-MANDATORY-FAILING (NEW enum) INSTEAD of the formula string V1.8:413 — or, if the string is kept, :rule STRING inert) — 1 fact; `aggregation-order` (id reliance-of__<VALUE>; :aggregation ref; :value SYMBOL RelianceClass member; :ordinal INTEGER 1..4 ascending, V1.8:412) — 4 facts. Rendering: :order values are bare symbols while RelianceClass declares keywords (V1.8:83) and row 8 :failure uses keywords — one rendering (N12)."
