(adjudication ADJ-259 :class SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY__define-file-disposition :item "A11-SR-CASEGRAMMAR-SPLIT-SEAT (SR dossier) = A14 CASEGRAMMAR SPLIT TWICE (V1.6 dossier): two seats, one rule")
(adjudication ADJ-260 :class SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY__define-file-disposition :item "ADJ-MX4-SPLIT-ENUM (new): SPLIT/MOVE/REMOVE are declared dispositions at source (SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY.sexp:6) and absent from the model enum (MODEL-SCHEMA.sexp:51) — the model's disposition vocabulary is a strict subset of the registry's and nothing records the reduction")
(adjudication ADJ-261 :class SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY__define-file-disposition :item "ADJ-MX4-SPLIT-L5 (new): a single tracked path with a PUBLIC and a PRIVATE owner has no representable shape in the model's single-valued ownership families and is the first case where L5 must rule on a FILE rather than a type")
(adjudication ADJ-262 :class SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY__define-file-disposition :item "ADJ-MX4-SPLIT-BATCH (new): DDI-1 and DDI-2 classes consume the '[general]' seat token this class defines (3 dag.json order violations)")
