(adjudication ADJ-294 :class V1.6-SCHEMAS__define-invariant :item "ADJ-MX4-RATV6I17-ANCHOR (new): rationale RAT-V6I-17 (rationale-references.sexp:3) names :doc \"SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY.sexp\" while :V6I-17 is defined at V1.6-SCHEMAS.sexp:348 — the anchor resolves textually against a header comment (SUBSYSTEM-REGISTRY.sexp:3) and points away from the definition; no check would notice")
